# Assets Directory Security Policy
Options -Indexes

<IfModule mod_rewrite.c>
    RewriteEngine On
    RewriteCond %{HTTP_REFERER} !^$
    RewriteCond %{HTTP_REFERER} !^https?://(www\.)?appledger\.in [NC]
    RewriteCond %{HTTP_REFERER} !^https?://localhost [NC]
    RewriteCond %{HTTP_REFERER} !^https?://127\.0\.0\.1 [NC]
    RewriteRule \.(jpg|jpeg|png|gif|ico|svg|webp)$ - [F,NC]
</IfModule>
